{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】神舟二十四號載人飛船成功與太空站交會對接。</p>\n<p>飛船靠近太空站天和核心艙，之後精準對接並鎖緊，在上午11時56分成功對接太空站，整個對接過程歷時3.5小時。</p>\n<p>神舟二十四號3名航天員在艙壓調整好之後，將會進入天和核心艙，而神舟二十三號航天員已做好準備迎接他們，實現「太空會師」。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:43:53.613158+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:18:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:25.312530+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:25.312530+00:00","content_hash":"687d844dda6500aade65b61e8a6cb267e04b120e007322cfc50a5c2d3f609042","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}